Midnight Clad Armor is the planar armor set for both cloth and leather wearing classes; similar to how Lustrous Russet Armor is for both chain and plate classes. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 2|Group 2 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]].  Additionally, [[Phoboplasm]]s in non-raid [[Plane of Fear]] instances can be farmed for this armor set.

